Package: kurenai
Architecture: all
Depends: bash (>= 4.0), ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: curl, pciutils, iproute2
Suggests: nvidia-driver
Description: neon-red system information panel for the terminal
 kurenai prints a compact two-column panel with system, hardware,
 performance and memory information, using only Bash and the standard
 /proc and /sys interfaces.
 .
 It can run once, for example from a shell startup file, or stay open
 as a live monitor with an adjustable refresh interval and pause.
